    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Carroll takes great pleasure in introducing No. 41 Meadow View, Avondale to the market. This turn-key, three-bedroom, semi-detached home and offers discerning purchasers well-proportioned accommodation to include an entrance hall, living room, kitchen/dining room, three bedrooms and a bathroom. There is also a garage with utility room and WC to the rear of the garage. Externally, the property is situated in a cul de sac position and benefits from off street parking and lawns to the front together with an enclosed south west facing garden at the rear ideal for al fresco dining during the summer months! \n\nAvondale is a mature, sought-after residential development convenient to Dundalk Town Centre, Aura Leisure Centre, Marshes Shopping Centre, Dundalk Retail Park, IDA Business & Technology Parks and the new WuXi Pharmaceutical facility. This location cannot be overstated with the N52 Inner Relief Road being only 750 metres from the residence providing easy access to M1 Motorway Junction 16. In addition, Blackrock Village is situated approx. 5km from the residence and boasts a seafront promenade, recreational activities, specialty shops, cafés and restaurants.\n\nThis home is sure to tick so many boxes for first time buyers, down sizers and investors!\n\nViewing is highly recommended and available by phoning the office on 0429332173 or requesting a viewing on www.mysherryfitz.ie."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nSitting Room - 4.83m x 3.46m\n\n\nKitchen/Diner - 5.29m x 3.05m\n\n\nUtility Room - 3.11m x 3.05m\n\n\nWC - 2.45m x 0.94m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 3.46m x 3.05m\n\n\nBedroom Two - 4.2m x 3.46m\n\n\nBedroom Three - 2.85m x 2.54m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.22m x 1.82m\n\n\n"
      },
